OL,3,GNEWSAWeather warning in place ahead of
OL,4,AStorm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FGusts up to 60mph (96kph) are forecast
OL,7,Fwidely, while coastal and exposed areas
OL,8,Fcould have gusts reaching up to 75mph
OL,9,F(120kph).
